# Pinned npm-published model catalog (pi-ai@1.1.0): the per-file sha256 hashes
# in .manifest.json must match the classpath bytes verbatim on every checkout,
# so treat the shards as binary — never let core.autocrlf rewrite their bytes.
pi-java-ai/src/main/resources/catalog/*.json -text
# Catalog generator: vendored files are hashed by VENDOR.json and snapshots by
# SOURCES.json, so their bytes must survive checkout unchanged too.
pi-java-ai/catalog-generator/** -text
